1. How to generate prebuild littlefs.bin
./genlittlefs.sh

2. How to download flash and nuttx binarys
a. Linux Version
dldtool download flash:
./dldtool -m 0x2c000000 /dev/ttyUSBx programmer2003.bin littlefs.bin

dldtool download both bl, ota, a7 and ap:
 ./dldtool /dev/ttyUSBx programmer2003.bin vela_bl.bin --addr 0x2C040000 vela_ota.bin --addr 0x2C0C0000 vela_ota.bin --addr 0x2C900000 vela_a7.bin -m 0x2C150000/0xBE57EC1C vela_ap.bin
or
./dldtool /dev/ttyUSBx  programmer2003.bin -m 0x2C150000/0xBE57EC1C vela_ap.bin // Only flash vela_ap.bin if vela_bl.bin and vela_ota.bin flashed already


b. Windows Version
dldtool download flash:
dldtool.exe COMx programmer2003.bin -m 0x2c000000 littlefs.bin
dldtool.exe COMx programmer2003.bin -m 0x2c000000 vela_a7.bin

dldtool download both ota and nuttx:
dldtool.exe COMx  programmer2003.bin vela_bl.bin --addr 0x2C040000 vela_ota.bin --addr 0x2C0C0000 vela_ota.bin --addr 0x2C900000 vela_a7.bin -m 0x2C150000/0xBE57EC1C vela_ap.bin
or
dldtool.exe COMx  programmer2003.bin -m 0x2C150000/0xBE57EC1C vela_ap.bin

3.How to download to sd card

dldtool.exe COMx  programmer2003_emmc.bin --addr 0x(block_seq)  vela_ap.bin

block size is 512bytes,we can use like

dldtool.exe 9  programmer2003_emmc.bin --addr 0x1 vela_ap.bin

this means our com num is 9 and real addr is 1*512

